        "heading": "Headless search",
        "body": "Concise output. Same index under .reqlan.",
        "code": "npx reqlan search \"empty password\"",
        "code_lang": "bash",
        "code_label": "terminal"
      },
      "notes": "Compact results on purpose — same discipline as chat search."
    },
    {
      "id": "analyse-parse",
      "transition": "fade",
      "background": "brand-panel",
      "content": {
        "heading": "Analyse and parse",
        "body": "One idea expanded. Parse as CI gate on reqs/.",
        "code": "npx reqlan analyse --idea login_api / parse reqs/ --fail-on-diagnostics",
        "code_lang": "bash",
        "code_label": "terminal"
      },
      "notes": "Fail the build when requirements stop parsing."
    },
    {
      "id": "index-base",
      "transition": "none",
      "background": "brand-contrast",
      "content": {
        "heading": "One base per run",
        "body": "Index is tooling memory. Nested bases = separate runs.",
        "code": "demo/.reqlan/ · --cwd · active base picker",
        "code_lang": "txt",
        "code_label": "example"
      },
      "notes": "Do not hand-edit the index. Confirm cwd when results look wrong."
